id: E2026101010
draft: true
trigger_tool: original Fortran MPI example runner
phase: upstream-tests
error_signature: Fortran STOP returns zero after an application ERROR RETURN; save/restore uses literal read-only tmp
severity: 2
category: original-oracle, return-code, temporary-path, fortran, mpi, ohos
title: 原测试的零退出码必须与功能输出及数值 oracle 同时核验
match_keywords: STOP zero, ERROR RETURN, task-private save directory, GET_ENVIRONMENT_VARIABLE STATUS LENGTH, numerical residual, original example inventory, delivered SONAME, shared-link output identity
root_cause: 原Fortran程序把清理路径作为STOP出口而未传失败退出码，库错误可以产生RC0；测试驱动若只检查进程RC会把未到达求解结果的保存恢复失败误计PASS。硬编码/tmp则忽略目标沙箱真实可写目录。
affected_scope: 原示例或旧测试以输出表达错误、退出码不能完整表达功能终态且含持久化路径的数值程序；不适用于已具有严格错误退出码或未知崩溃原因的测试。
verification_cmd: preserve original case IDs and matrices; run original examples through real MPI; reject ERROR RETURN; verify real/complex expected solutions and actual save/restore; audit same-run receipts and original numerical output hashes
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: bounded-private-directory-and-functional-output-oracle
rec_description: 不删除原失败用例或矩阵。只让保存恢复目录读取经长度和STATUS校验的任务环境；变量缺失保留上游默认，其余错误闭锁。运行器同时要求真实RC0、无原错误输出、到达原功能标记并逐值验证真实数值；实例创建例与数值求解例分别计数。
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: GET_ENVIRONMENT_VARIABLE with LENGTH and STATUS; bounded C getenv; independent output parser retaining original case inventory and expected real/complex solutions
forbid_1_pattern: RC0.*only|STOP.*PASS|ignore.*ERROR.RETURN
forbid_1_reason: 退出码不能替代库级错误和数值结果，真实失败必须保留。
forbid_2_pattern: cross.run.*PASS|remove.*save.restore|fake.*MPI|reduce.*denominator
forbid_2_reason: 原11用例、真实MPI语言ABI和同事务分母必须保全。
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/E2026101010-draft-MMP1.md
source_event: r003原保存恢复RC0却ERROR RETURN -71及此前数值oracle反例保留；r585同一正式Conan/原本地门禁真实11/11、消费者4/4、鸿蒙1/1、实际交付SONAME6/6和L5 PASS，独立observed SHA256 176099c0bdee2d15361c412c8d78915e4bf2ff2a4866df8e378dfee4e7307380。数值成功不能代替共享库交付身份；原绿色build95859存在真实SONAME缺陷，r576工具名缺失另属检查能力错误，分别保留。不是提供者发布或新HEAD平台CI PASS。
verification_increment: 共享链接参数只对精确交付basename补齐SONAME，原正确显式值不重复、冲突值拒绝、compile-only不注入；实际成品readelf动态节逐项核验，不能由argv或数值运行推断。缺检查器和产物缺陷须分开定位，任务私有工具透传不能弱化原门禁。
